hatun Religion Sunni Islam Life edit In 1092 , when Malik Shah I was assassinated shortly after Nizam al-Mulk , Taj al-Mulk nominated Mahmud as Sultan and set out for Isfahan .", "original_document_number": 5}], "initial_answers": ["Mustafa II", "Malik Shah I"]}
